// Renovate, for this repository.
//
// This is the one repository where the toolchain group in the shared preset
// does its real work: vite, vitest, typescript and @playwright/test are
// *dependencies* here, and a bump of one arrives as fix(deps):, ships as a
// patch of @lautstark/toolchain, and reaches every app through the shared
// packages rule - one branch per app, merged when that app's tests pass.
//
// The .json5 is spelled out on purpose: the //path/to/file syntax implies a
// .json extension, so omitting it looks for a file that is not there and
// Renovate stops before it does anything.
//
// A major is the exception that rule needs: Renovate writes it as fix(deps):
// too, which would ship typescript 7 as a toolchain patch and let every app
// merge it unattended. The trailer below makes semantic-release cut a major
// instead, and the shared preset holds a major for a person in every app.
{
  $schema: "https://docs.renovatebot.com/renovate-schema.json",
  extends: ["github>Lautstark/.github//renovate-shared.json5"],
  packageRules: [
    {
      matchDepTypes: ["dependencies"],
      matchUpdateTypes: ["major"],
      commitBody: "BREAKING CHANGE: {{{depName}}} moves to {{{newMajor}}}.",
    },
  ],
}
